{"thread":{"threadID":4083,"boardID":117,"topic":"Changelog - 12.01.2017","time":1484251984,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1484396414,"lastPoster":"PEYZO","replies":5,"views":372,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":9},"tags":[{"tagID":386,"name":"Arena"},{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":716,"name":"fun"},{"tagID":1023,"name":"german"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":295,"name":"knife"},{"tagID":1024,"name":"rounds"}],"posts":[{"postID":59132,"threadID":4083,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Changelog - 12.01.2017","time":1484251984,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":9,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1484252154,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1484252288,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1484253526,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1484255080,"value":1},{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1484257425,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1484261157,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1484309327,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1484311573,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1484318009,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br><strong>--- Arena Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden dem Server hinzugefügt (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2199-oxygen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@OxygeN</a> für einige der Vorschläge):<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>am_anothernuke</li>\n<li>am_backyardstorage</li>\n<li>am_columns</li>\n<li>\nam_dream_laboratory <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=838775281\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">(map by Nachtfrische)</a>\n</li>\n<li>\nam_dream_western <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=836472600\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">(map by Hypnoxas)</a>\n</li>\n<li>am_marble</li>\n<li>am_must2</li>\n<li>am_sky_realm_final</li>\n<li>am_sluice</li>\n<li>am_storage</li>\n<li>am_th_civilaction2</li>\n<li>am_xenon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong></strong><br><strong>--- Funrounds Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden dem Server hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>de_bikinibottom</li>\n<li>de_boardroom</li>\n<li>de_dust_classic</li>\n<li>de_dust2_classic</li>\n<li>de_hijack</li>\n<li>de_nuketown</li>\n<li>de_rats_1337_v2</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bugfixes:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto Bunnyhop funktioniert nun ohne Probleme</li>\n<li>Hive365 wurde behoben</li>\n<li>Decoy Rounds wurden entfernt</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Ich arbeite daran, das Knife bei Granatenrounds und bei bestimmten Rounds zu deaktivieren. Zurzeit funktioniert es, jedoch crasht der Server nach Beendigung der Runde. Aufgrund dessen ist zurzeit die normale Version des Plugins drauf.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Zwei neue Funrounds wurden hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DREAM Scout Knives (Scout + Knife mit low Gravity)</li>\n<li>DREAM Nachtfrische Special (PP-Bizon, umgekehrte Tasten, niedrigere Gravity, erhöhte Geschwindigkeit, man kann nicht stehen bleiben)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Solltet ihr Ideen für weitere Runden bei Funrounds haben, dürft ihr sie gerne hier vorschlagen!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59135,"threadID":4083,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1484252617,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1484253541,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1484311571,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1484392303,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nice to see that there are new maps for funrounds  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👍</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thank you <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> for playing the maps I choose, hope the community likes them as much as I loved to test them  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👍</span>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Waiting for more great news like this  <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span>  <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59137,"threadID":4083,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1484253250,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schönes Ding <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59138,"threadID":4083,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1484255545,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nice. Gutes Changelog wiedermal.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59139,"threadID":4083,"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","subject":"","time":1484255903,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1484256424,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1484261153,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[